+#   legend_panel:
+#     - A fixed 8x9 orange-framed panel occupies one corner in canonical orientation.
+#     - Its top mini-scene shows a green 3-cell L-marker plus one yellow cell that marks
+#       the forward step leaving the L's elbow.
